{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0144_1009_p", "source_sha256": "7e00d190dd53da406757725377c0be58047e410cc56b6b90ad9855c181900746", "ja": "ああ、そういうことか……\nええと、翼、すごく似合ってる！　可愛いぞ！", "zh": "啊，原来是这么回事……\n呃～翼，你穿起来非常好看！很可爱喔！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "card_blst_016tsu0144_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_blst_016tsu0144_1010_016tsu", "source_sha256": "2a3a638c9f71b9f937ebf7f80e992729cf3ec55a19138de6597c8f099bfd1b05", "ja": "そんなんじゃダメ～！\nもっともっと、すっごくほめてください～！", "zh": "那样不行～！\n你要更大力、更大力地称赞～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
